<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa, sugar end softer.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa, sugar end softer.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Nearbys end narrowly easier after short session ahead of a UK trade dinner in London. Nov down $3 at $1,520.</p>
<p>COCOA - Slips further but off lows after origin selling. March down five stg at 1,009 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Nearbys turn lower after NY impetus. Commission sales, scale-down trade buying cited. Dec down 70 cents at $322.50.</p>
</text>
